<p>Hai kouno makan me aaj matam duniya se uthe Rasule Akram,<br>
Dil par hai yeh kainaat ke gham duniya se uthe Rasule Akram.</p>

<p>Taboot Nabi ka uth raha hai sar nange har ek barehna paa hai,<br>
Rote hai nawase sar kiye qam, duniya se uthe Rasule Akram.</p>

<p>Behosh hai beti Mustafa ki be aas hai ab har ek nawasi,<br>
Yasrab me hai ek hoo ka aalam duniya se uthe Rasule Akram.</p>

<p>Aapeh me nahi madine wale behosh hai sab qareene wale,<br>
Kunba hai tamaam sarfe matam duniya se uthe Rasule Akram</p>